# Your own AT commands. Same format as the vendor files:
#   ## Group             a section header in the drop-down list
#   # What it does        a description of the command below it
#   AT+COMMAND            the command, sent to the modem as-is
# '#' lines are never sent. Add your commands below — this file is yours and
# survives package upgrades. A couple of examples to start from:

## My commands

# Modem information
ATI

# Signal quality
AT+CSQ
